# Pinned apps for all users (GNOME dock: dconf default favorite-apps; KDE task manager: Plasma update script).
# A user can change the pins; the user setting then stays. "@filemanager" is Nautilus (GNOME) or Dolphin (KDE).
@filemanager
firefox.desktop
google-chrome.desktop
mld-o365-outlook.desktop
mld-o365-teams.desktop
mld-o365-word.desktop
mld-o365-excel.desktop
mld-o365-powerpoint.desktop
mld-o365-onedrive.desktop
